    "buyTrend": "no new preannouncement in 21 days AND beginner questions repeat >=3 times in 7 days from distinct verified accounts; unavailable identity evidence must not be inferred",
    "stopOrLiquidate": "mentions fall >=70% from prior hype peak OR V2/clone/second-batch announcement OR same complaint is independently corroborated across >=3 sources",
